<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mossimo cut by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mossimo cut by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Mossimo Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate and maintained its long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock slumped 4-1/8 to 17-3/4.</p>
</text>
